  "term_and_condition": "<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"367\" data-start=\"106\">Welcome to the <strong data-end=\"165\" data-start=\"121\">Chattanooga Beard Co. Affiliate Program!</strong> By signing up, you agree to comply with the terms outlined below. These terms govern the relationship between <strong data-end=\"301\" data-start=\"276\">Chattanooga Beard Co.</strong> (&ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or &ldquo;merchant&rdquo;) and <strong data-end=\"348\" data-start=\"334\">affiliates</strong>(&ldquo;you,&rdquo; &ldquo;your&rdquo;).</p>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"508\" data-start=\"369\">If you <strong data-end=\"392\" data-start=\"376\">do not agree</strong> to these Terms &amp; Conditions, you are <strong data-end=\"448\" data-start=\"430\">not authorized</strong> to register as an affiliate or participate in any manner.</p>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"627\" data-start=\"510\">We <strong data-end=\"534\" data-start=\"513\">reserve the right</strong> to modify, suspend, or terminate this program at any time, for any reason, without notice.</p>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none;\" data-end=\"632\" data-start=\"629\">\r\n<h2 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"679\" data-start=\"634\"><strong data-end=\"677\" data-start=\"637\">1. Affiliate Approval &amp; Registration</strong></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"965\" data-start=\"680\">\r\n<li data-end=\"780\" data-start=\"680\">We <strong data-end=\"727\" data-start=\"685\">reserve the right to approve or reject</strong> any affiliate registration at our sole discretion.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"882\" data-start=\"781\">Our decision is <strong data-end=\"808\" data-start=\"799\">final</strong> and affiliates have no legal recourse if their application is rejected.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"965\" data-start=\"883\">We may remove or suspend inactive or non-compliant affiliates <strong data-end=\"962\" data-start=\"947\">at any time</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none;\" data-end=\"970\" data-start=\"967\">\r\n<h2 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"1016\" data-start=\"972\"><strong data-end=\"1014\" data-start=\"975\">2. Affiliate Links &amp; Discount Codes</strong></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"1804\" data-start=\"1017\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1143\" data-start=\"1017\">Your <strong data-end=\"1049\" data-start=\"1024\">unique affiliate link</strong> is automatically generated. You may also create links for specific products or collections.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1257\" data-start=\"1144\">If a <strong data-end=\"1195\" data-start=\"1151\">customer clicks multiple affiliate links</strong>, the <strong data-end=\"1229\" data-start=\"1201\">most recent link clicked</strong> is credited for the sale.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1391\" data-start=\"1258\"><strong data-end=\"1279\" data-start=\"1260\">Discount Codes:</strong> Affiliates may receive a <strong data-end=\"1335\" data-start=\"1305\">personalized discount code</strong> to share with their audience (10% off for customers).</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1513\" data-start=\"1392\">If a customer <strong data-end=\"1459\" data-start=\"1408\">uses both a discount code and an affiliate link</strong>, commission is <strong data-end=\"1490\" data-start=\"1475\">not doubled</strong>&mdash;only one will count.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1629\" data-start=\"1514\"><strong data-end=\"1542\" data-start=\"1516\">Prohibited Activities:</strong> Affiliates <strong data-end=\"1565\" data-start=\"1554\">may not</strong> share unapproved coupon codes or promote CBC on coupon sites.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1804\" data-start=\"1630\">You may promote <strong data-end=\"1697\" data-start=\"1648\">CBC&rsquo;s website on digital and offline channels</strong> (e.g., social media, email, blogs, magazines, etc.), but paid ads using CBC&rsquo;s brand name are prohibited.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none;\" data-end=\"1809\" data-start=\"1806\">\r\n<h2 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"1854\" data-start=\"1811\"><strong data-end=\"1852\" data-start=\"1814\">3. Commission Structure &amp; Payments</strong></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"2624\" data-start=\"1855\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1937\" data-start=\"1855\"><strong data-end=\"1877\" data-start=\"1857\">Commission Rate:</strong> Affiliates earn <strong data-end=\"1912\" data-start=\"1894\">15% commission</strong> on each eligible sale.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2099\" data-start=\"1938\"><strong data-end=\"1959\" data-start=\"1940\">Payment Method:</strong> Commissions are <strong data-end=\"2020\" data-start=\"1976\">paid on the 1st of each month via PayPal</strong>. Affiliates must provide accurate payment details in their account settings.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2223\" data-start=\"2100\"><strong data-end=\"2121\" data-start=\"2102\">Eligible Sales:</strong> Commission is calculated based on <strong data-end=\"2221\" data-start=\"2156\">order value (excluding taxes, shipping, and additional fees).</strong></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2365\" data-start=\"2224\"><strong data-end=\"2246\" data-start=\"2226\">Tracking Period:</strong> Sales are credited to affiliates if they occur within the <strong data-end=\"2329\" data-start=\"2305\">30-day cookie window</strong> after a customer clicks the link.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2509\" data-start=\"2366\"><strong data-end=\"2394\" data-start=\"2368\">Refunds &amp; Chargebacks:</strong> If a transaction is <strong data-end=\"2465\" data-start=\"2415\">refunded, disputed, or results in a chargeback</strong>, no commission will be paid on that sale.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2624\" data-start=\"2510\">We <strong data-end=\"2536\" data-start=\"2515\">reserve the right</strong> to review, adjust, or withhold commissions for <strong data-end=\"2621\" data-start=\"2584\">fraudulent or suspicious activity</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none;\" data-end=\"2629\" data-start=\"2626\">\r\n<h2 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"2674\" data-start=\"2631\"><strong data-end=\"2672\" data-start=\"2634\">4. Marketing Materials &amp; Promotion</strong></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"3052\" data-start=\"2675\">\r\n<li data-end=\"2814\" data-start=\"2675\">We may provide <strong data-end=\"2712\" data-start=\"2692\">marketing assets</strong> (banners, logos, promotional images) via the <strong data-end=\"2781\" data-start=\"2758\">Marketing Tools tab</strong> for use on affiliate channels.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2924\" data-start=\"2815\">Affiliates may <strong data-end=\"2866\" data-start=\"2832\">download or embed these assets</strong> but are prohibited from altering them without approval.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3052\" data-start=\"2925\">Any misleading claims, false advertising, or unauthorized promotions will result in <strong data-end=\"3032\" data-start=\"3011\">immediate removal</strong> from the program.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none;\" data-end=\"3057\" data-start=\"3054\">\r\n<h2 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"3101\" data-start=\"3059\"><strong data-end=\"3099\" data-start=\"3062\">5. Affiliate Network (If Enabled)</strong></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"3538\" data-start=\"3102\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3206\" data-start=\"3102\">If the <strong data-end=\"3140\" data-start=\"3111\">Network feature is active</strong>, affiliates can invite others to join as &ldquo;downline&rdquo; affiliates.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3348\" data-start=\"3207\"><strong data-end=\"3230\" data-start=\"3209\">Upline affiliates</strong> receive a <strong data-end=\"3263\" data-start=\"3241\">network commission</strong> from their <strong data-end=\"3305\" data-start=\"3275\">downline affiliates&rsquo; sales</strong> (percentage based on merchant settings).</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3453\" data-start=\"3349\"><strong data-end=\"3375\" data-start=\"3351\">Inviting Affiliates:</strong> You may recruit new affiliates by sharing your <strong data-end=\"3450\" data-start=\"3423\">network invitation link</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3538\" data-start=\"3454\">We <strong data-end=\"3480\" data-start=\"3459\">reserve the right</strong> to <strong data-end=\"3503\" data-start=\"3484\">limit or modify</strong> network commissions at any time.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none;\" data-end=\"3543\" data-start=\"3540\">\r\n<h2 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"3581\" data-start=\"3545\"><strong data-end=\"3579\" data-start=\"3548\">6. Cookie Policy &amp; Tracking</strong></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"4039\" data-start=\"3582\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3658\" data-start=\"3582\"><strong data-end=\"3611\" data-start=\"3584\">Cookies must be enabled</strong> for affiliate tracking to function properly.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3785\" data-start=\"3659\">The <strong data-end=\"3695\" data-start=\"3665\">cookie duration is 30 days</strong>&mdash;if a customer makes a purchase within this period, the referring affiliate gets credit.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3896\" data-start=\"3786\">If a customer <strong data-end=\"3845\" data-start=\"3802\">clears their cookies or blocks tracking</strong>, we <strong data-end=\"3894\" data-start=\"3850\">cannot track sales or issue commissions.</strong></li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4039\" data-start=\"3897\"><strong data-end=\"3922\" data-start=\"3899\">Coupon Code Backup:</strong> Even if cookies are disabled, commissions <strong data-end=\"3989\" data-start=\"3965\">may still be tracked</strong> if the customer uses an assigned discount code.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none;\" data-end=\"4044\" data-start=\"4041\">\r\n<h2 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"4087\" data-start=\"4046\"><strong data-end=\"4085\" data-start=\"4049\">7. Program Termination &amp; Removal</strong></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"4564\" data-start=\"4088\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4433\" data-start=\"4088\"><strong data-end=\"4116\" data-start=\"4090\">Affiliate Termination:</strong> We <strong data-end=\"4141\" data-start=\"4120\">reserve the right</strong> to remove an affiliate at any time, for any reason, including but not limited to:\r\n<ul data-end=\"4433\" data-start=\"4228\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4301\" data-start=\"4228\">Fraudulent activity, misleading promotions, or misuse of CBC&rsquo;s brand.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4380\" data-start=\"4304\">Spamming, unethical marketing, or promoting unauthorized discount codes.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4433\" data-start=\"4383\">Non-compliance with these terms or local laws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4564\" data-start=\"4434\"><strong data-end=\"4462\" data-start=\"4436\">Affiliate Resignation:</strong> If you wish to leave the program, you can request removal by emailing <strong data-end=\"4561\" data-start=\"4533\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-end=\"4559\" data-start=\"4535\">Todd@chattanoogabeard.co</a></strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none;\" data-end=\"4569\" data-start=\"4566\">\r\n<h2 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"4614\" data-start=\"4571\"><strong data-end=\"4612\" data-start=\"4574\">8. Modifications &amp; Program Updates</strong></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"4839\" data-start=\"4615\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4733\" data-start=\"4615\">We <strong data-end=\"4641\" data-start=\"4620\">reserve the right</strong> to update, modify, or terminate this program at any time, for any reason, without notice.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4839\" data-start=\"4734\">Continued participation in the program after updates <strong data-end=\"4815\" data-start=\"4789\">constitutes acceptance</strong> of the revised terms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none;\" data-end=\"4844\" data-start=\"4841\">\r\n<h2 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"4881\" data-start=\"4846\"><strong data-end=\"4879\" data-start=\"4849\">9. Limitation of Liability</strong></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"5242\" data-start=\"4882\">\r\n<li data-end=\"4999\" data-start=\"4882\">Chattanooga Beard Co. is <strong data-end=\"4928\" data-start=\"4909\">not responsible</strong> for lost earnings, technical issues, or third-party platform errors.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"5109\" data-start=\"5000\">We <strong data-end=\"5025\" data-start=\"5005\">do not guarantee</strong> commissions or affiliate success&mdash;earnings depend on individual marketing efforts.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"5242\" data-start=\"5110\">Affiliates <strong data-end=\"5149\" data-start=\"5123\">agree to indemnify CBC</strong> against any legal claims, damages, or losses resulting from participation in this program.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none;\" data-end=\"5247\" data-start=\"5244\">\r\n<h2 style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"5279\" data-start=\"5249\"><strong data-end=\"5277\" data-start=\"5252\">10. Contact &amp; Support</strong></h2>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"5353\" data-start=\"5280\">If you have any questions, concerns, or need assistance, contact us at:</p>\r\n<p style=\"white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\" data-end=\"5395\" data-start=\"5355\"><strong data-end=\"5368\" data-start=\"5358\">Email:</strong> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-end=\"5393\" data-start=\"5369\">Todd@chattanoogabeard.co</a></p>",
